# Bot1 has stolen Bot2's Memnite with Control Magic and attacks with it; Bot2's Steel Wall and Phyrexian Walker both block it.
# After combat Bot2 destroys Control Magic, so Memnite is Bot2's again (CR 613.1b), and Bot1 casts Glyph of Reincarnation at
# Bot2's Wall. Memnite dies into its owner's graveyard, but the card comes from the graveyard of the player who controlled
# it the last time the Wall blocked it - Bot1, neither its owner nor its controller as it died - and enters under Bot1's
# control, its owner's. A reading of either of the others would offer only Bot2's graveyard, which holds Memnite.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Control Magic
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mox Emerald
Glyph of Reincarnation
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Steel Wall
Memnite
Phyrexian Walker
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Island
Island
Island x20
