Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite)
Bot2.Block(Steel Wall > Memnite; Phyrexian Walker > Memnite)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
